# 300|optional|codex-mcp-recovery|/absolute/path/to/collectors/codex-mcp-recovery|900
# 400|optional|browser-recovery|/absolute/path/to/collectors/browser-recovery|300
# 500|optional|knowledge-recovery|/absolute/path/to/collectors/knowledge-recovery|900
# 600|optional|docker-recovery|/absolute/path/to/collectors/docker-recovery|3600
# 700|optional|github-recovery|/absolute/path/to/collectors/github-recovery|3600
# 750|optional|gitlab-recovery|/absolute/path/to/collectors/gitlab-recovery|3600
# 800|optional|server-recovery|/absolute/path/to/collectors/server-recovery|3600
# 900|optional|manual-backup|/absolute/path/to/collectors/manual-backup|60
